<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Nakamasu et al. (2009) 3-variable zebrafish pigment-cell reaction-diffusion network, laser-ablation polarity & leopard (cx41.8) spot-to-stripe morphospace — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the exact 3x3 Nakamasu et al. (2009) Jacobian J0, short-range (u, v) saddle minor det(J_uv) = -1.61 < 0, k = 0 Routh-Hurwitz invariants (p1 = 2.50, p2 = 1.63, p3 = 2.961, p1*p2 - p3 = 1.114 > 0), and dispersion curve sigma(k) across k in [0, 6.5] (L100-198); integrates the 2D nonlinear 3-species (u, v, w) reaction-diffusion PDE with saturating synthesis rates and horizontal myoseptum X0 pioneer guidance via DCT-II IMEX (L204-312); reproduces Nakamasu (2009) Figs. 2-3 laser-ablation experiments in silico (L318-415); and backs all 3 laws with machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_007_zebrafish_three_cell_stripes.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Nakamasu et al. (2009) 3-variable zebrafish pigment-cell reaction-diffusion network, laser-ablation polarity & leopard (cx41.8) spot-to-stripe morphospace — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L610-675) computes 8 reference-backed morphometrics covering short-range 2x2 minor det(J_uv) = -1.61, Routh-Hurwitz stability margin p1*p2 - p3 = 1.114, critical wavenumber k_c = 3.4110, characteristic stripe wavelength lambda_c = 1.8420, 2D PDE melanophore-xanthophore anti-phase correlation r_uv = -1.000, xanthophore laser-ablation melanophore loss fraction (0.8342 vs >0.45 threshold), equal-diffusion and no-repulsion negative-control amplitude suppression (9.78e-4 and 1.25e-7 vs 0.5770), and segmented Danio rerio trunk inter-stripe wavelength (23.67 px, CV = 0.1109)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
